                                                        <p class="brfprofile"><b>Brief Profile:</b> Prof.(Dr.) Deepak
                                                            Bansal is a Doctorate in Finance from Uttarakhand Technical
                                                            University, Dehradun. He is the Master of Business
                                                            Administration with specialization in Finance & Marketing
                                                            from AKTU, Lucknow. He is the Master of Philosophy from
                                                            Madurai Kamraj University, Madurai and the Master of
                                                            Commerce from CCS University, Meerut. He is a bachelor in
                                                            Education and Commerce. He has worked in various management
                                                            institutes of repute in NCR Region. Presently he is
                                                            associated with GIMS, Greater Noida as Professor & Dean
                                                            (Finance Area). His area of interest includes Venture
                                                            Capital Financing, Financial Modelling, Taxation Policy,
                                                            Financial Management, Accounting for Management, Financial
                                                            Derivatives, Mergers, Acquisitions & Corporate
                                                            Restructuring, and Financial Markets & Institutions. He has
                                                            more than 21 years of academic, industry & research
                                                            experience. He is in editorial board of repute journals. He
                                                            has presented several research papers in
                                                            National/International Journals and Conferences. He has
                                                            organized and attended several workshops, conferences,
                                                            seminars, FDPs and summits of national and international
                                                            repute. He has been successfully contributing as a certified
                                                            trainer for Financial Modelling and Accounting Software
                                                            ‘Tally ERP’, specially tailored for young management
                                                            graduates.
                                                            As a passionate teacher and organizer, he has organized
                                                            enormous student-oriented co-curricular and extracurricular
                                                            activities, which additionally support his efforts for
                                                            achieving OBE in the parent institute and other
                                                            universities.
                                                            Dr. Bansal has contributed to the development of different
                                                            SOPs for Online Education during COVID-19, Quality of
                                                            e-Contents, effective execution of MOOC programs on
                                                            different platforms, and Quality of assignments and lectures
                                                            in management education.
                                                            As a speaker/panellist, he has organized and attended many
                                                            national and international seminars & conferences in the
                                                            field of Management Enabled Education and Basic Commerce. He
                                                            has delivered invited talks on financial planning and wealth
                                                            management in many leading Indian institutes and
                                                            universities from time to time.
                                                        </p>
